VERSION 2
RULE baseline.mobile.android.framework.jetpack.android_cleartext_traffic_enabled VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "android:usesCleartextTraffic\\s*=\\s*\"true\"|cleartextTrafficPermitted\\s*=\\s*true" "im"
REPORT "Android Cleartext Traffic Enabled"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
